Rules:
- Draft 3-6 rubric dimensions, each with a distinct name, drawn from what the job description actually asks for.
- Weights are relative importance; make the ones that matter most to this role heavier.
- Draft 5-10 questions that a screening call can realistically cover in {{ max_minutes }} minutes.
- Mark a question required only if a candidate who cannot answer it is not worth advancing.
- Use "extract" for answers that are a concrete value worth storing (e.g. notice_period_days,
